    .desc = A Mentor watching to help.
wg-mentor-watch-refused-ticket = You can only do that on a question you hold.
wg-mentor-watch-refused-busy = You're already with someone, or waiting for their answer.
wg-mentor-watch-refused-asker = They aren't in the round right now.
wg-mentor-watch-refused-lobby = Join the round or observe first.
